{"type":"message","id":"eded16dc","parentId":"a6e350f5","timestamp":"2026-03-10T08:20:27.170Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see - the last call at 16:19:38 started getting the QR code but it took about 30 seconds and returned 204 (No Content). This suggests the browser automation is timing out or failing.\n\nLooking at the log, the service is trying to launch a headless browser for the bot5 profile, but it's taking too long or failing.\n\nLet me check if there's an issue with the bot5 profile or if the browser is having trouble starting. Let me also check if maybe I should use a different approach - perhaps the browser profile already has cookies and I just need to verify the login status.\n\nActually, looking at the earlier successful calls at 16:18:01 and 16:18:11, those completed in about 3-5 seconds. The later calls are timing out at 30 seconds.\n\nLet me try checking the login status again - maybe the account is actually already logged in from an earlier session.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d429a788a7cf4aca82173ef0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"timeout 15 npx mcporter call \"xiaohongshu-mcp.check_login_status\" --account_id bot5 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":67872,"output":477,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68349,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773130811530}}
