{"type":"message","id":"563e7fc8","parentId":"0e71952b","timestamp":"2026-03-10T08:20:54.375Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The calls are consistently timing out. There might be an issue with the headless browser starting. Let me check if there are any zombie browser processes or if the profile directory has some issue.\n\nActually, looking at the logs again, the earlier calls (16:18:01, 16:18:11) succeeded quickly. Then my Python script calls failed because they didn't pass account_id. Then the mcporter calls started timing out.\n\nMaybe the browser instances are getting stuck. Let me try killing any browser processes and restarting the MCP service.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4b464656b8b24bb69a954765","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pkill -9 -f \"xiaohongshu-mcp\"; sleep 2; XHS_PROFILES_DIR=/home/rooot/.xhs-profiles nohup /home/rooot/MCP/xiaohongshu-mcp/xiaohongshu-mcp -headless=true -port=:18060 > /tmp/xiaohongshu-mcp.log 2>&1 &\nsleep 3\ncurl -s http://localhost:18060/health"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":68284,"output":373,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68657,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773130847712}}
