{"type":"message","id":"801acadb","parentId":"050d5914","timestamp":"2026-03-10T08:21:05.884Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The exec command is being killed. This might be a system-level timeout or restriction. Let me try a simpler approach - just report to the user what's happening and ask them to scan the QR code manually, or try a different method.\n\nActually, looking at the situation:\n1. The MCP service is running\n2. The bot5 profile exists with cookies\n3. But the tool calls are timing out when trying to launch the headless browser\n\nThe issue might be that the headless browser is having trouble starting in this environment. Let me inform the user about the situation and suggest an alternative approach.\n\nActually, I should inform the user that I'm having technical difficulties with the MCP service and ask if they want me to try a different approach or if they can help troubleshoot.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"研究部，我遇到点技术问题🤒\n\n小红书 MCP 服务已经启动了，bot5 的账号配置也存在（/home/rooot/.xhs-profiles/bot5 目录有浏览器 profile 和 cookies）。但是调用登录检查工具时一直超时，可能是 headless 浏览器启动有问题。\n\n我刚才试了几种方法：\n1. ✅ MCP 服务已启动，健康检查正常\n2. ✅ bot5 的 profile 目录存在，有 Cookies 文件\n3. ❌ 调用 `check_login_status` 和 `get_login_qrcode` 工具时超时（30 秒）\n\n**两个方案：**\n\n1. **研究部手动扫码**：如果研究部之前在这个设备上登录过 bot5，可能 cookies 还在。我可以用浏览器方式打开小红书创作者中心看看是否已登录。\n\n2. **重启服务再试**：可能是浏览器进程卡住了，需要彻底清理后重启。\n\n研究部想让我试哪个方案？或者有别的方式登录吗？🪙"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":68586,"output":544,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69130,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773130854423}}
{"type":"message","id":"94874c4b","parentId":"801acadb","timestamp":"2026-03-10T08:21:06.457Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"研究部，我遇到点技术问题🤒\n\n小红书 MCP 服务已经启动了，bot5 的账号配置也存在（/home/rooot/.xhs-profiles/bot5 目录有浏览器 profile 和 cookies）。但是调用登录检查工具时一直超时，可能是 headless 浏览器启动有问题。\n\n我刚才试了几种方法：\n1. ✅ MCP 服务已启动，健康检查正常\n2. ✅ bot5 的 profile 目录存在，有 Cookies 文件\n3. ❌ 调用 `check_login_status` 和 `get_login_qrcode` 工具时超时（30 秒）\n\n**两个方案：**\n\n1. **研究部手动扫码**：如果研究部之前在这个设备上登录过 bot5，可能 cookies 还在。我可以用浏览器方式打开小红书创作者中心看看是否已登录。\n\n2. **重启服务再试**：可能是浏览器进程卡住了，需要彻底清理后重启。\n\n研究部想让我试哪个方案？或者有别的方式登录吗？🪙"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773130866457}}
